  answerChoices: []
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  infographic: {fileID: 0}
  instruction: 'HYBRID EXPERIENCE (Headset On)


    You are about to complete a
    learning activity in virtual reality using a 2D interface displayed within the
    VR environment.


    The activity consists of a series of infographic slides
    presented in a random order, followed by a short multiple-choice quiz designed
    to assess your understanding of the material.


    A timer is displayed in the
    top-left corner of each slide. When the timer reaches zero, the next slide will
    automatically appear. If a quiz question is not answered before time expires,
    it will be marked as incorrect.


    Use the VR controllers to interact with
    the interface. Review the content carefully and answer each question to the best
    of your ability.

'
